T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `GET /health`: service liveness.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /install.sh`: provider install script.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /nodes`: authenticated marketplace inventory.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /my-nodes`: authenticated provider-owned nodes.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /metrics`: authenticated dashboard metrics and GPU SKU inventory.) Tj
