(- `POST /agent/heartbeat`: authenticated provider heartbeat.) Tj
T*
(- `POST /presign`: authenticated encrypted upload/result URLs.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /jobs`: authenticated owner-scoped job list.) Tj
T*
(- `POST /jobs`: authenticated encrypted job submission.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /jobs/{id}/status`: authenticated owner-scoped job detail.) Tj
T*
(- `PUT|POST /storage/upload/{id}`: authenticated local dev encrypted upload.) Tj
T*
(- `PUT|POST /storage/result-upload/{id}`: authenticated local dev encrypted result upload.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /storage/result/{id}`: authenticated owner-scoped result download.) Tj
T*
(- `GET /ws`: WebSocket job update channel, authenticated by first message.) Tj
T*
(- `GET|POST /billing/*`: authenticated Razorpay customer, token, usage, charge, and) Tj
T*
(  transaction APIs.) Tj
T*
(- `POST /billing/webhook`: Razorpay webhook with HMAC signature verification.) Tj
T*
(- `GET|POST /api/keys`: API key listing and creation.) Tj
T*
