(Node Orchestration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Provider installs and runs the edge agent with a Tenxo API key.) Tj
T*
(2. Agent POSTs `/agent/heartbeat` or publishes `heartbeats.{node_id}` with status, GPU model,) Tj
T*
(VRAM, owner, and attestation state.) Tj
T*
(3. Matchmaker persists node state and exposes fresh nodes with a 90-second liveness window.) Tj
T*
(4. Consumer uploads encrypted workload through `/presign`, then submits `/jobs`.) Tj
T*
(5. Matchmaker stores owner-scoped job metadata and publishes a `jobs` JetStream message.) Tj
T*
(6. Worker claims the job, executes it, uploads encrypted results, and publishes `jobs.results`.) Tj
T*
(7. Matchmaker updates job state and broadcasts the event to the consumer over `/ws`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Payment Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Consumer opens billing and the frontend calls `/billing/customer`.) Tj
T*
(2. Backend creates or reuses a Razorpay customer bound to the authenticated user.) Tj
T*
(3. `/billing/setup-intent` creates a small verification order.) Tj
T*
(4. Razorpay Checkout returns order, payment, and signature values.) Tj
T*
(5. `/billing/verify-payment` validates the HMAC signature and stores the returned token.) Tj
T*
(6. Usage is started/stopped by trusted job lifecycle events through `/billing/track-usage`.) Tj
T*
(7. `/billing/charge` or auto-charge creates a Razorpay order and recurring payment with the) Tj
T*
(saved token.) Tj
T*
(8. `/billing/webhook` records captured payments and updates paid totals.) Tj
T*
(9. `/billing/transactions` returns usage and payment history for the dashboard.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
