(Current allocation is queue-oriented. Available idle nodes are surfaced through `/nodes` and) Tj
T*
(`/metrics`; jobs enter the `jobs` JetStream work queue with optional requested GPU metadata.) Tj
T*
(Workers decide eligibility based on local GPU inventory and job requirements. Production scaling) Tj
T*
(should add explicit reservation records with node locks, requested SKU, memory floor, lease TTL,) Tj
T*
(and idempotent release on completion or timeout.) Tj
