(Deployment Topology) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Production topology:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- CDN or platform routing terminates TLS for the Next.js frontend.) Tj
T*
(- Matchmaker API runs behind HTTPS with `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` pinned to frontend origins.) Tj
T*
(- PostgreSQL runs in a private network with backups and restricted credentials.) Tj
T*
(- NATS JetStream runs with file storage, auth, persistence, and private networking.) Tj
T*
(- R2/S3-compatible storage holds encrypted payloads and results.) Tj
T*
(- Edge agents connect outbound only to HTTPS/NATS endpoints.) Tj
T*
(- Razorpay webhook endpoint is public but HMAC verified.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Security controls:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Supabase JWT or hashed `txn_` API key auth on protected routes.) Tj
T*
(- Owner-scoped job, node, billing, and storage reads.) Tj
T*
(- API keys are stored as SHA-256 hashes.) Tj
T*
(- Webhooks and payment verification use HMAC checks.) Tj
T*
(- Local file storage sanitizes IDs and confines paths to the upload root.) Tj
T*
(- Browser CORS and WebSocket origins must be restricted in production.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
